{"5083410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Pagodia", "steam_appid": 5083410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales of Pagodia is a simple city builder that blends surreal environments and pick-and-place building mechanics. Freely hand-pick pagoda buildings and place down on top of a variety of wooden platforms, sprawling cliffs, and giant artsy podiums. Tales of Pagodia is an ideal fun, cozy and easy city builder with visually striking environments, choice of background music, and a functional flying airship in 2 levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Tales of Pagodia is built on:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments: Cliffs, Clouds, Flying Eagle, Walking Turtle and Stomping Royal Elephants are all of the levels you can build magnificent cities in. Cliffs and Clouds levels allow for extra large cities and breathtaking views. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5083410/extras/32fa0eaf6f0dc78296a647c0ee7a53d7.avif?t=1787083679\" width=826 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanics: Simple movement controls and and easy pick-and-place building functionality. Platforms can easily be placed and rotated. Delete tool available. Zoom in and out functionality. Basic music playlist functionality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5083410/extras/5c8e19dd59adfff0b8c67503e1ae7046.avif?t=1787083679\" width=826 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airship: Simple controls and camera functionality adds depth 